{"path":"chemistry/experiments/lab/gas-prep","title":"气体制备与净化（先除杂后干燥）","type":"example","html":"<p>实验室用大理石（CaCO₃）与稀盐酸制取二氧化碳，要得到<strong>纯净干燥</strong>的 CO₂，下列净化方案正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 气体依次通过饱和 NaHCO₃ 溶液 → 浓硫酸</p>\n<p>B. 气体依次通过浓硫酸 → 饱和 NaHCO₃ 溶液</p>\n<p>C. 气体依次通过 NaOH 溶液 → 浓硫酸</p>\n<p>D. 只通过浓硫酸</p>\n<ul>\n<li>气体除杂&quot;万能顺序&quot;：<strong>净化（除杂）→ 干燥（除水）→ 收集/尾气</strong>；</li>\n<li>常见除杂试剂速查：CO₂ 中 HCl → 饱和 NaHCO₃；Cl₂ 中 HCl → 饱和食盐水（<strong>NaCl 溶液不吸收 Cl₂</strong>）；CO₂ 中水 → 浓硫酸；NH₃ 中水 → 碱石灰（<strong>不能用浓硫酸</strong>，会被吸收）；</li>\n<li>装置选择看状态条件：固+固加热（试管口略向下）、固+液不加热（启普发生器）、液+液加热（圆底烧瓶+分液漏斗）；</li>\n<li>风险：干燥剂与气体反应则不能选（浓硫酸吸 NH₃、碱石灰吸 CO₂）——&quot;谁和谁反应&quot;永远先查。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>杂质分析</strong>：稀盐酸易挥发出 HCl，且混有水蒸气 ⇒ 杂质为 HCl 和 H₂O。</p>\n<p><strong>除 HCl</strong>：用饱和 NaHCO₃ 溶液（HCl 与 HCO₃⁻ 反应放出 CO₂，CO₂ 不与饱和 NaHCO₃ 反应）：</p>\n<p class='katex-block'><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nH^++HCO_3^-=CO_2\\uparrow+H_2O\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>除水</strong>：浓硫酸干燥（它不吸收 CO₂，只吸水）。</p>\n<p><strong>顺序</strong>：先除杂后干燥（干燥管放在最后，防止再引入水蒸气）：</p>\n<p>饱和 NaHCO₃ 溶液 → 浓硫酸。选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：净化装置选择题 → <strong>两个口诀秒杀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;先除杂，后干燥&quot;</strong>；<strong>&quot;除 HCl 用饱和 NaHCO₃，除 CO₂ 用 NaOH&quot;</strong>（天然互补：NaHCO₃ 吸 HCl 放 CO₂，NaOH 吸 CO₂）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>A：除 HCl ✓ → 干燥 ✓，顺序对；</li>\n<li>B：先干燥后除杂（走过 NaHCO₃ 溶液又带水）✘；</li>\n<li>C：NaOH 把 CO₂ 也吸收了 ✘；</li>\n<li>D：HCl 没除 ✘。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>20 秒锁定 A</strong>。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"实验室用大理石（CaCO₃）与稀盐酸制取二氧化碳，要得到 纯净干燥 的 CO₂，下列净化方案正确的是（ ） A. 气体依次通过饱和 NaHCO₃ 溶液 → 浓硫酸 B. 气体依次通过浓硫酸 → 饱和 NaHCO₃ 溶液 C. 气体依次通过 ","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"中档","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"除杂试剂不能与目标气体反应（除 CO₂ 中的 HCl 用饱和 NaHCO₃，不能用 NaOH——NaOH 会把 CO₂ 也吸收）；先除杂后干燥的顺序不能颠倒。","fit":["实验室制取纯净干燥 CO₂/H₂/Cl₂ 等","装置与试剂选择、净化顺序","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Feb 17 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"lab","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"gas-prep","title":"气体制备与净化（先除杂后干燥）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"design-evaluation","title":"实验方案设计与评价","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验专题","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"gas-purify","title":"气体净化与干燥顺序（除杂为先、干燥在后）","type":"example"},{"slug":"haloalkane-br-test","title":"溴乙烷中溴元素的检验","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-flow-example","title":"工业流程除杂（调 pH 不引杂质）","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-process","title":"化学工艺流程题模板","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"solution-prep-error","title":"配制溶液误差分析（定容俯仰视）","type":"example"}]}